```dart
Future<String?> moveTo(String? entryId, {...}) async {
  final seal = _seal;
  if (seal != null && seal.isSealed) {
    seal.rejectWrite('leaf_move');
    return null;
  }
  ...
}
```

Also — are there other direct `_storage.appendEntry` / `setLeafId` callers that run in the post-completion window? `setLeafId` callers: moveTo, session commands, resume paths — all interactive. Fine.

Now run the test.

